			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 60280301,
					"content": "如何，傷口還痛嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280302,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280303
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280303,
					"content": "我找人準備了一些可能會用到的藥品，需要就吃吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280304,
						60280305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280304,
					"content": "謝謝…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280306
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280306,
					"content": "那，我把事件發生後和艾莉絲女士的通話內容複述一下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280307,
					"content": "多托雷那個傢伙，為了吸引「魔女會」的注意，在提瓦特的邊界做了大文章。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾莉絲"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280308,
					"content": "我一直以為是來自世界外的深淵力量在干擾提瓦特，這是相當常見的情況。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾莉絲"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280309,
					"content": "但是在杜林你們成功干涉了挪德卡萊的虛影之後，我意識到這種干擾也有可能來自提瓦特內部。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾莉絲"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280310,
					"content": "可是，我們並沒有改變虛影的命運啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280311,
					"content": "對，你們沒有影響那個虛影的結局，但是某種「變數」被堆砌到了你的身上。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾莉絲"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280312,
					"content": "「變數」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280313,
					"content": "嗯，比如你們聽到了本來無從得知的消息，或是產生了原本不會萌發的想法，這都算是「變數」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾莉絲"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280314,
					"content": "當然這種事在幾乎無窮無盡的可能性面前，並不算什麼，可是當它被刻意堆砌，概念就不一樣了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾莉絲"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280315,
					"content": "而這一切「變數」，便是讓多托雷能夠在這一晚，在你們開啟傳送門的時候達成自己陰謀的必要條件。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾莉絲"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280316,
					"content": "不過，具體多托雷做了什麼，我們還無從得知。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280317,
					"content": "嗯，還要搞清楚哥倫比婭的現狀如何。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280318,
					"content": "大概就是這樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280319,
					"content": "和我想的一樣，多托雷完全消失了，但至少他並沒有如願控制哥倫比婭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280320,
					"content": "但現狀可能比那更糟…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280321
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280321,
					"content": "唔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280322,
						60280323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280322,
					"content": "她為了破壞「博士」的計畫…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280324
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280324,
					"content": "欸，是這樣嗎？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280325,
					"content": "你們沒看到嗎？她跳了進去…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280326
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280326,
					"content": "#我們只看到「博士」出現，使用了某種力量，接著他和哥倫比婭就都消失了，{F#妳}{M#你}也從空中掉進了海裡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280327,
					"content": "（原來如此，「博士」鎖定了時間，只有我可以自由行動。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280328
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280328,
					"content": "（在他們眼裡，那場戰鬥和哥倫比婭的決斷都只是一瞬間的事。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280329
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280329,
					"content": "（這就是「三月」的權能嗎…我沒受到影響…是因為我是「降臨者」？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280330
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280330,
					"content": "所以，哥倫比婭主動開啟了「月之門」，落入了雷利爾和索琳蒂絲曾踏入的神秘空間…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280331
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280331,
					"content": "凶多吉少啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280332
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280332,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280333,
						60280334
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280333,
					"content": "所以多托雷一直躲著我們…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280335
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280335,
					"content": "這麼看來，「三月現世」，還有獵月人的出現…恐怕背後都有多托雷在操縱。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280336
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280336,
					"content": "按照艾莉絲女士的說法，他想做的事，就是超越自己的命運，完成只有神才能完成的實驗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280337
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280337,
					"content": "…真是個瘋狂的傢伙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280338
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280338,
					"content": "對了，阿帽呢？他怎麼不在這裡？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280339
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280339,
					"content": "在和艾莉絲女士通訊之後，他說有些眉目，就拿走了嘟嘟通訊儀，獨自去調查了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280340
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280340,
					"content": "臨走的時候他的表情變得很可怕，我從來沒見過他那副樣子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280341
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280341,
					"content": "（應該是憤怒和不甘心吧…明明已經在提防多托雷了，卻還是被他搶先了一步。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280342
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280342,
					"content": "（這麼說的話，我又何嘗不是這樣…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280343
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280343,
					"content": "我回來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280344
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280344,
					"content": "阿帽！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280345
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280345,
					"content": "我又去找了那些「亥珀波瑞亞」的虛影，總算是搞清楚了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280346
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280346,
					"content": "我讓他們和通訊儀另一邊的尼可細細對質，發現他們描述的歷史和尼可的記憶果然是不同的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280347
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280347,
					"content": "為什麼會這樣？尼可應該不會出錯才對。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280348
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280348,
					"content": "因為被騙的是那些虛影。他們的歷史裡出現了一個根本就不該存在的救世主。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280349
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280349,
					"content": "這個救世主許諾他們能夠在虛假之天內創造一個新的月亮，還能把他們的月神帶回來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280350
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280350,
					"content": "這些人愚蠢地相信了他，將他所需要的關於月亮的知識全部告訴了他。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280351
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280351,
					"content": "一聽就知道，這是多托雷在搞鬼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280352
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280352,
					"content": "在亥珀波瑞亞的遺蹟中，聽虛影聊起歷史，尼可會說裡面有些錯誤…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280353
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280353,
					"content": "可是多托雷應該沒辦法進入那扇門啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280354
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280354,
					"content": "他沒進去過。尼可說，這是同時代的虛影因果關係被干擾後引發的異樣狀況。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280355
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280355,
					"content": "而多托雷所堆砌的「變數」，甚至大到能夠對不曾見過的虛影造成影響。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280356
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280356,
					"content": "原來不是記憶不清，而是被篡改了啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280357
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280357,
					"content": "這就是多托雷想方設法堆砌的可能性，他將變數化為知識，都堆砌在了自己的身上。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280358
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280358,
					"content": "「祈月之夜」的夜晚…他用這些知識，真的創造了一輪「偽月」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280359
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280359,
					"content": "這怎麼可能做到？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280360
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280360,
					"content": "正確來說，是讓術法的感知出現了偏差——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280361
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280361,
					"content": "術法透過月矩力感受月亮的位置，只要「偽月」比天外的霜月更像月亮…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280362
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280362,
					"content": "那扇門就會把哥倫比婭送到「偽月」的位置，也就是多托雷身邊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280363
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280363,
					"content": "在多托雷控制了哥倫比婭之後，傳送術法依然維持著，他又操縱她的力量，奪走了兩塊月髓。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280364
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280364,
					"content": "那個時候，月髓從我們眼前突然消失…離開遺蹟的時候，為時已晚。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280365
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280365,
					"content": "那時候，多托雷已經集齊了三月的力量。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280366
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280366,
					"content": "現在要…如何是好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280367
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280367,
					"content": "我想知道女皇陛下的想法，之前和她提及的擔心果然發生了。但我們也不能一味等待女皇陛下的決斷…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280368
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280368,
					"content": "將我們視作朋友的，並非愚人眾執行官「少女」，而是哥倫比婭·希珀塞萊尼婭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280369
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280369,
					"content": "在此嚴峻情形下，如果女皇陛下仍然執意禁止執行官之間的兵刃相向…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280370
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280370,
					"content": "那我也將遵從內心的選擇，以「佩露薇利」的身分出戰。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280371
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280371,
					"content": "阿蕾奇諾…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280372
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280372,
					"content": "時間緊迫，我先走一步。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280373
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280373,
					"content": "就連阿蕾奇諾好像也變得不太冷靜了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280374
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280374,
					"content": "（可能她覺得這件事有她的責任，而我也是同樣…可惡。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280375
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280375,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280376
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280376,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280377
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280377,
					"content": "來來來，大家不要都喪著臉，聽我說兩句。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280378
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280378,
					"content": "情況很糟，非常糟。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280379
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280379,
					"content": "多托雷採取了每位騎士都會唾棄的方式，僥倖獲得了一時之利。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280380
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280380,
					"content": "連魔女都說他用「變數」影響了命運，哈哈，但我看未必。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280381
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280381,
					"content": "我聽過很多人告訴我，提瓦特的命運既定——事實好像真的如此，那多托雷憑什麼能讓自己成為例外呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280382
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280382,
					"content": "既然多托雷可以堆砌「變數」，我們怎麼不行？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280383
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280383,
					"content": "#而且，{F#妳}{M#你}就更不應該沮喪了，遠道而來的旅人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280384
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280384,
					"content": "一切都還沒結束呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280385,
						60280386
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280385,
					"content": "嗯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280387
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280387,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}不是一個人。這裡的所有人，說話的、不說話的，全都在自責。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280388
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280388,
					"content": "但我們沒有一個人是會躺在安樂椅上曬太陽的傢伙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280389
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280389,
					"content": "#即便被擊倒，也會很快站起來，這才是騎士之道！不要忘了，榮譽騎士{F#妳}{M#你}可是我們蒙德的正統騎士！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280390
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280390,
					"content": "嗯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280391
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280391,
					"content": "法爾伽說得對，還沒結束呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280392
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280392,
					"content": "至少多托雷這個傢伙，我們要痛揍他一頓，新帳舊帳一起算！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280393
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280393,
					"content": "這才像話。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280394
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280394,
					"content": "其他人呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280395
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280395,
					"content": "我會藉助月矩力調查哥倫比婭的下落，我也不願意就此放棄。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280396
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280396,
					"content": "發生在挪德卡萊的事情，「秘聞館」想知道就一定能知道。情報這邊我來提供。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280397
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280397,
					"content": "「叮鈴哐啷蛋捲工坊」也會提供全力支援，我和愛諾計劃逆向研究多托雷的本次行動，尋找突破口。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280398
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊涅芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280398,
					"content": "雖然艾莉絲女士和尼可女士要解決提瓦特邊界的突發災害，暫時回不來…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280399
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280399,
					"content": "但她們都很生氣，要求我和阿貝多作為「魔女會」的代理人不留餘力地對抗多托雷。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280401
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280401,
					"content": "準備好了？前期也有許多研究工作要做。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280402,
					"content": "我會盡力的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280403,
					"content": "我算是瞭解多托雷的行事風格，能嘗試預測他的下一步行動。調查上我來幫忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280404,
					"content": "嗯，聽起來算是有個初步分工了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280405,
					"content": "我會和菲林斯與葉洛亞取得聯絡，請他們找執燈長談，讓「執燈人」也站在我們這一邊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280406,
					"content": "同時我也會交代挪德卡萊的西風騎士，盡全力協助「執燈人」和其他組織，保護此處民眾的安全。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280407,
						60280408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280407,
					"content": "我知道了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280409
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280409,
					"content": "對，誰怕誰啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280410,
					"content": "嗯，各位加油。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280408,
					"content": "做好迎接一切的準備。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280409
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280386,
					"content": "我有些自責。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280387
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280334,
					"content": "就是在準備這個計畫。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280335
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280323,
					"content": "跳進了「月亮倒影」之中。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280324
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280305,
					"content": "還是盡快進入正題吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
